    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-11" id="fn-11" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents the Annual Charge Adjustment ("ACA"), which is an annual fee charged by the FERC and recovered from the shippers.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-12" id="fn-12" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Cheyenne Connector remeasured its accumulated deferred income taxes (Account 282 and 283) during the year ended December 31, 2023 based on the new tax rates stemming from a change in ownership, which resulted in the entity no longer being classified as a Master Limited Partnership. The remeasurement resulted in an increase in the accumulated deferred income tax asset. This adjustment was recorded in Account 182.3, Other Regulatory Assets. The balance is amortized to Account 410.1, Provision of Deferred Income Taxes, over the estimated remaining useful life of the pipeline.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-13" id="fn-13" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents over collections pursuant to Cheyenne Connector's tarrif Lost and Unaccounted-for Gas tracking mechanisms.</link:footnote>
